Z||000005||mwbackus||02-17-2000||04:50 PM||||I think it interesting when a seller places such a premium on a Fiero specific Getrag.  Thanks to Rodney Dickman, we have a plethora of much less expensive transmissions to choose from:<P>Cavalier 87-89<BR>6000 87-88<BR>Beretta 87-89<P>Celebrity 87-88<BR>Corsica 87-89<BR>Cimarron 87-88<P>Fierenza 87<P>It is his conversion kit (~$80) that makes this possible.  I for one, am glad that he is a member of this forum!<P>Mike||||reg||1
